# Raw third-party data is NOT committed. Fetch it from the primary sources
# (URLs + licences + checksums in data/PROVENANCE.md) and re-run build_db.py.
# Keeping FAOSTAT data out of the repo also avoids redistributing it under
# FAO's non-commercial / third-party terms.
data/*
!data/PROVENANCE.md

# DuckDB build artifact (rebuildable from the raw CSVs via build_db.py)
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.duckdb.tmp/

# Local virtual environment
.venv/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
